@startuml Preciazo_Shopping_Planning_Classes
title Preciazo - Shopping Planning Domain (AV2 - US07-US12 / US18)
set namespaceSeparator none
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho


class ShoppingList <<Aggregate>> {
    -id: Long
    -ownerId: Long
    -name: String
    -currency: String
    -status: ListStatus
    -version: Long
    -completedAt: Instant [0..1]
    -sourceTemplateId: Long [0..1]
    -creationKey: String [0..1]
    -creationFingerprint: String [0..1]
    +addItem(requirement: ProductRequirement, quantity: Quantity): ShoppingListItem
    +removeItem(itemId: Long): void
    +reduceItemQuantity(itemId: Long, quantity: Quantity): void
    +markItemPurchased(itemId: Long): void
    +unmarkItemPurchased(itemId: Long): void
    +calculateEstimatedTotal(): Money
    +calculateCheckoutTotal(): Money
    +assignBudget(budget: PurchaseBudget): void
    +complete(): void
}

class ShoppingListItem {
    -id: Long
    -quantity: Quantity
    -estimatedUnitPrice: UnitPrice
    -catalogEntryId: Long [0..1]
    -priceCapturedAt: Instant [0..1]
    -priceOfferVersion: Long [0..1]
    -purchased: Boolean
    +changeQuantity(quantity: Quantity): void
    +updateEstimatedPrice(price: UnitPrice): void
    +markPurchased(): void
    +unmarkPurchased(): void
    +estimatedSubtotal(): Money
}

class ProductRequirement <<Value Object>> {
    -productId: Long {readOnly}
    -requestedName: String {readOnly}
    +matchesProduct(productId: Long): Boolean
}

class PurchaseBudget {
    -id: Long
    -limit: Money
    +changeLimit(amount: Money): void
}

class Money <<Value Object>> {
    -amount: Decimal {readOnly}
    -currency: String {readOnly}
    +add(other: Money): Money
    +subtract(other: Money): Money
    +multiply(factor: Decimal): Money
    +isLessThan(other: Money): Boolean
    +isGreaterThan(other: Money): Boolean
    +isDifferentFrom(other: Money): Boolean
    +isPositive(): Boolean
}

note right of Money
  Immutable; equality by amount and currency.
  Arithmetic and comparisons require the same currency.
  Operations return new values.
end note

enum ListStatus {
    ACTIVE
    COMPLETED
}

ShoppingList ..> ListStatus : lifecycle
ShoppingList "1" *-- "0..*" ShoppingListItem : contains
ShoppingListItem "*" --> "1" ProductRequirement : requests
ShoppingList "1" *-- "0..1" PurchaseBudget : owns
ShoppingListItem "*" --> "1" UnitPrice : estimated price
ShoppingListItem "*" --> "1" Quantity : requested amount

note right of ShoppingList
  US08: A missing name defaults to the current date and time.
  US09: One item per product; adding it again sums quantities.
  Quantities must be positive and use compatible units.
  US11: Estimated total sums all item subtotals.
  US12: Checkout total sums purchased item subtotals only.
  Marking/unmarking is idempotent; unmarking subtracts the subtotal.
  Empty totals are zero in the list currency.
  One optional budget per list; changing it replaces its limit.
end note

class Quantity <<Value Object>> {
    -amount: Decimal {readOnly}
    -unit: String {readOnly}
    +add(other: Quantity): Quantity
    +subtract(other: Quantity): Quantity
    +isPositive(): Boolean
}

note right of Quantity
  Immutable; amount >= 0; unit is not blank.
  Equality by amount and unit; arithmetic requires the same unit.
  Subtraction cannot produce a negative amount.
  Requested purchase quantities must be positive.
end note

class UnitPrice <<Value Object>> {
    -price: Money {readOnly}
    -perUnit: Quantity {readOnly}
    +costFor(quantity: Quantity): Money
    +isLessThan(other: UnitPrice): Boolean
}

note right of UnitPrice
  Immutable; equality by price and perUnit.
  Price >= 0; perUnit amount > 0.
  Cost and comparisons require compatible units
  and the same currency.
end note

UnitPrice "1" --> "1" Money : monetary value
UnitPrice "1" --> "1" Quantity : priced quantity

note right of ProductRequirement
  Immutable local reference to a catalog product.
  Equality by productId and requestedName.
end note

PurchaseBudget "1" --> "1" Money : limit
note right of PurchaseBudget
  US10: Limit must be positive and match the list currency.
  Invalid changes preserve the existing limit.
  The limit is advisory: exceeding it does not block item changes.
end note



class ShoppingTemplate <<Aggregate>> {
 -id: Long
 -ownerId: Long
 -name: String
 -currency: String
 -sourceListId: Long
 -sourceListVersion: Long
 -saveKey: String
 -saveFingerprint: String
 -createdAt: Instant
 +fromCompletedList(list: ShoppingList): ShoppingTemplate
}
class TemplateItem <<Value Object>> {
 -productId: Long {readOnly}
 -requestedName: String {readOnly}
 -quantity: Quantity {readOnly}
}
class FavoriteStore <<Aggregate>> {
 -id: Long
 -ownerId: Long
 -storeId: Long
 -active: Boolean
 -version: Long
 +add(): void
 +remove(): void
}
class OfferSelection <<Value Object>> {
 -productId: Long {readOnly}
 -catalogEntryId: Long {readOnly}
 -expectedOfferVersion: Long {readOnly}
}
class CurrentPriceSnapshot <<Value Object>> {
 -productId: Long {readOnly}
 -catalogEntryId: Long {readOnly}
 -offerVersion: Long {readOnly}
 -price: UnitPrice {readOnly}
 -available: Boolean {readOnly}
 -capturedAt: Instant {readOnly}
}
ShoppingTemplate "1" *-- "1..*" TemplateItem
TemplateItem --> Quantity
ShoppingTemplate ..> ShoppingList : copies completed source
ShoppingList "0..*" --> "0..1" ShoppingTemplate : optional origin by identity
CurrentPriceSnapshot --> UnitPrice
OfferSelection ..> CurrentPriceSnapshot : selection must match trusted snapshot
note bottom of ShoppingTemplate
 Immutable snapshot of all requested products and quantities, owned by the buyer.
 Source must be COMPLETED and nonempty, with expected list version.
 No prices, purchase flags, members or budget are copied into the template.
 A save-key retry returns the existing template; changed request -> conflict.
end note
note bottom of ShoppingList
 New ordinary and template-based lists start ACTIVE; no unused DRAFT workflow.
 Complete is explicit, idempotent and requires a nonempty ACTIVE list.
 Completion does not assert every requested product was bought.
 COMPLETED lists are read-only and eligible as template sources.
 Template instantiation creates a new ACTIVE list with purchased=false for all items.
 Validate one current, available, compatible selected offer per template product.
 Missing/stale prices reject the whole operation; never reuse historical prices or zero.
 Save complete clone atomically; its later changes cannot mutate template/source.
end note
note bottom of FavoriteStore
 UNIQUE(ownerId, storeId); remove deactivates, re-add reactivates the same identity.
 Repeated add/remove is idempotent and emits no duplicate domain event.
 Removal needs ownership, not a live external store reference.
 Preferences never alter prices, distance, coverage or store eligibility.
end note

@enduml
